## Frozen snapshot, fetched directly rather than through approx.
##
## - Used by the build IMAGE, where approx is not yet running and 127.0.0.1 is the
##   build container, so the proxied debian_stable_frozen_clearnet.sources cannot serve it.
## - Same pin as that file, so image tooling and the build resolve one snapshot.
## - Both archives take the same timestamp; snapshot.debian.org resolves a pin per
##   archive to the nearest preceding snapshot.
## - dm-update-frozen-snapshot rewrites this timestamp with the other pin files and
##   refuses when they disagree. Keep timestamp-shaped strings out of these comments:
##   the pin is read from the 'URIs:' lines.
Types: deb
URIs: https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/20260730T083809Z
Suites: trixie trixie-updates
Components: main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
Enabled: yes
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg

Types: deb
URIs: https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian-security/20260730T083809Z
Suites: trixie-security
Components: main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
Enabled: yes
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg
